<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, user-scalable=yes">
    <meta name="description" content="CryptoNovice - Educate, inform, and equip crypto beginners with the best tools, platforms, and articles.">
    <meta name="keywords" content="crypto, bitcoin, ethereum, defi, crypto education, blockchain, tools, platforms, podcasts, articles, NFTs, privacy coins">
    <meta name="author" content="CryptoNovice">
    <title>CryptoNovice | Learn Crypto with Confidence</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 100 100'><text y='.9em' font-size='90'>₿</text></svg>">

    <!-- Google Fonts -->
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:opsz,wght@14..32,300;14..32,400;14..32,500;14..32,600;14..32,700;14..32,800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

    <!-- Font Awesome Icons -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">

    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            background: #0A0C12;
            color: #E8EDF5;
            line-height: 1.6;
            overflow-x: hidden;
            position: relative;
        }
        .landing-bg {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0; left: 0;
            width: 100%; height: 100%;
            z-index: -2;
            background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1639762681485-074b7f938ba0?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=1950&q=80');
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center;
            background-repeat: no-repeat;
        }
        .dark-overlay {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0; left: 0;
            width: 100%; height: 100%;
            background: rgba(10, 12, 18, 0.88);
            z-index: -1;
        }
        .grid-bg {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0; left: 0;
            width: 100%; height: 100%;
            background-image: 
                linear-gradient(rgba(0, 216, 255, 0.03) 1px, transparent 1px),
                linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0, 216, 255, 0.03) 1px, transparent 1px);
            background-size: 50px 50px;
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 0;
            animation: slowDrift 60s linear infinite;
        }
        @keyframes slowDrift {
            0% { transform: translate(0, 0); }
            100% { transform: translate(50px, 50px); }
        }
        .particles {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0; left: 0;
            width: 100%; height: 100%;
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 0;
        }
        .particle {
            position: absolute;
            background: rgba(0, 216, 255, 0.2);
            border-radius: 50%;
            animation: floatParticle 20s infinite ease-in-out;
        }
        @keyframes floatParticle {
            0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0) translateX(0); opacity: 0; }
            10% { opacity: 0.5; }
            90% { opacity: 0.5; }
            100% { transform: translateY(-100vh) translateX(100px); opacity: 0; }
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 1280px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 24px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
        }
        header {
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 100;
            background: rgba(10, 12, 18, 0.95);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0, 216, 255, 0.2);
        }
        .nav-container {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 16px 24px;
            max-width: 1400px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        .logo {
            font-size: 32px;
            font-weight: 800;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00D8FF, #8B5CF6);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            background-clip: text;
            color: transparent;
            letter-spacing: -1px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        .logo span {
            font-weight: 400;
            color: #E8EDF5;
            background: none;
            -webkit-background-clip: unset;
        }
        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 32px;
            align-items: center;
        }
        .nav-links a {
            color: #A0A8C0;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 500;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            font-size: 14px;
            cursor: pointer;
            padding: 8px 0;
            position: relative;
        }
        .nav-links a:hover, .nav-links a.active {
            color: #00D8FF;
        }
        .nav-links a.active::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 2px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #00D8FF, #8B5CF6);
            border-radius: 2px;
        }
        .google-btn {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            border: 1px solid rgba(0, 216, 255, 0.3);
            padding: 8px 16px;
            border-radius: 40px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            font-weight: 500;
            color: #E8EDF5;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        .google-btn:hover {
            background: rgba(0, 216, 255, 0.1);
            border-color: #00D8FF;
            transform: scale(1.02);
        }
        .user-avatar {
            width: 36px; height: 36px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00D8FF, #8B5CF6);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #0A0C12;
        }
        .mobile-menu-btn {
            display: none;
            font-size: 24px;
            cursor: pointer;
            color: #E8EDF5;
        }
        .mobile-nav {
            display: none;
            position: fixed;
            top: 70px; left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            background: rgba(10, 12, 18, 0.98);
            backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0, 216, 255, 0.2);
            padding: 20px 24px;
            z-index: 99;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 16px;
        }
        .mobile-nav a {
            color: #A0A8C0;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 500;
            font-size: 16px;
            padding: 8px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
        }
        .mobile-nav a:hover, .mobile-nav a.active {
            color: #00D8FF;
        }
        .page {
            display: none;
            padding: 40px 0 60px;
            animation: fadeIn 0.4s ease;
        }
        .page.active-page { display: block; }
        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }
        .btn-primary {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00D8FF, #8B5CF6);
            border: none;
            padding: 12px 28px;
            border-radius: 40px;
            color: #0A0C12;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            font-size: 16px;
            display: inline-block;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        .btn-primary:hover {
            transform: scale(1.02);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px -5px rgba(0, 216, 255, 0.4);
        }
        .btn-outline {
            background: transparent;
            border: 1px solid #00D8FF;
            padding: 12px 28px;
            border-radius: 40px;
            color: #00D8FF;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            display: inline-block;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        .btn-outline:hover {
            background: rgba(0, 216, 255, 0.1);
            transform: scale(1.02);
        }
        .btn-small { padding: 8px 20px; font-size: 14px; }
        .hero {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 60px 0 40px;
        }
        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 56px;
            font-weight: 800;
            line-height: 1.15;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFFFFF, #00D8FF);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            background-clip: text;
            color: transparent;
        }
        .hero p {
            font-size: 18px;
            color: #A0A8C0;
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: 0 auto 32px;
        }
        .hero-buttons {
            display: flex;
            gap: 16px;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }
        .section-title {
            font-size: 32px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            color: #FFFFFF;
        }
        .section-subtitle {
            text-align: center;
            color: #A0A8C0;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            font-size: 16px;
        }
        .mission-card {
            background: rgba(0, 216, 255, 0.05);
            border: 1px solid rgba(0, 216, 255, 0.2);
            border-radius: 32px;
            padding: 32px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            max-width: 900px;
            text-align: left;
        }
        .mission-card h2 {
            font-size: 24px;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            color: #00D8FF;
        }
        .mission-card p {
            color: #C8CED8;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            font-size: 15px;
        }
        .disclaimer-badge {
            background: rgba(255, 100, 100, 0.08);
            border-left: 4px solid #ff6b6b;
            padding: 16px 20px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            margin-top: 20px;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #ffaaaa;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .stats {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 64px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            padding: 40px 0;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            margin: 40px 0;
        }
        .stat-item { text-align: center; }
        .stat-number {
            font-size: 42px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #00D8FF;
            line-height: 1;
        }
        .stat-label {
            color: #A0A8C0;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-top: 8px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }
        .grid-3 {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 32px;
            margin: 40px 0;
        }
        .grid-2 {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(350px, 1fr));
            gap: 32px;
            margin: 40px 0;
        }
        .card {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
            border-radius: 24px;
            padding: 28px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        .card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-4px);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 35px -10px rgba(0, 216, 255, 0.15);
            border-color: rgba(0, 216, 255, 0.3);
        }
        .card-icon {
            font-size: 40px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            display: block;
        }
        .card h3 {
            font-size: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            color: #FFFFFF;
        }
        .card p {
            color: #A0A8C0;
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .card-link {
            color: #00D8FF;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 500;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
            margin-top: 16px;
            font-size: 14px;
            transition: gap 0.3s ease;
        }
        .card-link:hover { gap: 10px; }
        .card-meta {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding-top: 16px;
            margin-top: 16px;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #5A6275;
        }
        .card-tag {
            display: inline-block;
            background: rgba(0, 216, 255, 0.1);
            color: #00D8FF;
            padding: 4px 10px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 500;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }
        .article-reader {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
            border-radius: 24px;
            padding: 48px;
        }
        .article-reader h1 {
            font-size: 36px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            line-height: 1.2;
            color: #FFFFFF;
        }
        .article-reader h2 {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin: 32px 0 16px;
            color: #00D8FF;
        }
        .article-reader h3 {
            font-size: 20px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin: 24px 0 12px;
            color: #E8EDF5;
        }
        .article-reader p {
            color: #C8CED8;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }
        .article-reader strong { color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; }
        .article-reader ul, .article-reader ol {
            margin: 16px 0;
            padding-left: 24px;
            color: #C8CED8;
        }
        .article-reader li { margin-bottom: 8px; line-height: 1.6; }
        .article-reader a { color: #00D8FF; text-decoration: none; }
        .article-reader a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
        .article-reader .back-btn {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            color: #A0A8C0;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            transition: color 0.3s ease;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        .article-reader .back-btn:hover { color: #00D8FF; }
        .article-reader .article-meta-bar {
            display: flex;
            gap: 16px;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 32px;
            padding-bottom: 24px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }
        .article-reader .article-meta-bar span {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #5A6275;
        }
        .article-reader .article-meta-bar .tag {
            background: rgba(0, 216, 255, 0.1);
            color: #00D8FF;
            padding: 4px 12px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 500;
        }
        .article-reader blockquote {
            border-left: 3px solid #00D8FF;
            padding-left: 20px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            color: #A0A8C0;
            font-style: italic;
        }
        .article-reader .video-box {
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 24px 0;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .article-reader .video-box a { color: #00D8FF; font-weight: 500; }
        .term-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
            margin: 24px 0;
        }
        .term-card {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 24px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }
        .term-card:hover {
            border-color: rgba(0, 216, 255, 0.3);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }
        .term-card h4 {
            color: #00D8FF;
            font-size: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        .term-card p {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #A0A8C0;
            margin: 0;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }
        .step-card {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 24px;
            margin: 16px 0;
            position: relative;
            padding-left: 60px;
        }
        .step-number {
            position: absolute;
            left: 20px;
            top: 24px;
            width: 32px; height: 32px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00D8FF, #8B5CF6);
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #0A0C12;
        }
        .step-card h4 {
            color: #FFFFFF;
            font-size: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
        .step-card p {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #A0A8C0;
            margin: 0;
        }
        .newsletter {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0, 216, 255, 0.08), rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08));
            border-radius: 32px;
            padding: 48px;
            text-align: center;
            margin: 60px 0;
            border: 1px solid rgba(0, 216, 255, 0.15);
        }
        .newsletter h3 {
            font-size: 24px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            color: #FFFFFF;
        }
        .newsletter p {
            color: #A0A8C0;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }
        .newsletter-form {
            display: flex;
            gap: 12px;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }
        .newsletter-form input {
            padding: 12px 20px;
            border-radius: 40px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            color: white;
            width: 300px;
            font-size: 14px;
            outline: none;
            transition: border-color 0.3s ease;
        }
        .newsletter-form input:focus { border-color: #00D8FF; }
        .newsletter-form input::placeholder { color: #5A6275; }
        footer {
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
            padding: 48px 0 24px;
            margin-top: 60px;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
        }
        .footer-content {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
            gap: 40px;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }
        .footer-col h4 {
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            font-size: 16px;
            color: #00D8FF;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        .footer-col a, .footer-col p {
            display: block;
            color: #A0A8C0;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 13px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            transition: color 0.3s ease;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        .footer-col a:hover { color: #00D8FF; }
        .footer-bottom {
            text-align: center;
            padding-top: 24px;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #5A6275;
        }
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .nav-links { display: none; }
            .mobile-menu-btn { display: block; }
            .hero h1 { font-size: 36px; }
            .stats { gap: 32px; }
            .newsletter { padding: 32px 20px; }
            .logo { font-size: 26px; }
            .article-reader { padding: 24px; }
            .article-reader h1 { font-size: 26px; }
            .grid-3, .grid-2 { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .hero { padding: 30px 0 20px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="landing-bg"></div>
    <div class="dark-overlay"></div>
    <div class="grid-bg"></div>
    <div class="particles" id="particles"></div>

    <header>
        <div class="nav-container">
            <div class="logo" onclick="switchPage('home')">Crypto<span>Novice</span></div>
            <div class="nav-links" id="navLinks">
                <a data-page="home" class="active" onclick="switchPage('home')">Home</a>
                <a data-page="articles" onclick="switchPage('articles')">Articles</a>
                <a data-page="podcasts" onclick="switchPage('podcasts')">Podcasts</a>
                <a data-page="tools" onclick="switchPage('tools')">Tools & Platforms</a>
                <div class="google-btn" id="googleSignInBtn" onclick="handleSignIn()">
                    <i class="fab fa-google"></i> Sign In
                </div>
                <div id="userProfile" style="display: none;">
                    <div class="user-avatar" id="userAvatar">👤</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="mobile-menu-btn" id="mobileMenuBtn" onclick="toggleMobileMenu()">
                <i class="fas fa-bars"></i>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="mobile-nav" id="mobileNav">
            <a data-page="home" class="active" onclick="switchPage('home'); toggleMobileMenu()">Home</a>
            <a data-page="articles" onclick="switchPage('articles'); toggleMobileMenu()">Articles</a>
            <a data-page="podcasts" onclick="switchPage('podcasts'); toggleMobileMenu()">Podcasts</a>
            <a data-page="tools" onclick="switchPage('tools'); toggleMobileMenu()">Tools & Platforms</a>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main>
        <div class="container">

            <!-- ==================== HOME PAGE ==================== -->
            <div id="home-page" class="page active-page">
                <div class="hero">
                    <h1>From Zero to <br>Crypto Knowledgeable</h1>
                    <p>We simplify crypto by leading you to the best podcasts, tools, platforms, and articles. No hype, just education.</p>
                    <div class="hero-buttons">
                        <button class="btn-primary" onclick="switchPage('articles')">Read Articles →</button>
                        <button class="btn-outline" onclick="switchPage('podcasts')">Explore Podcasts →</button>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="mission-card">
                    <h2><i class="fas fa-bullhorn"></i> Our Mission</h2>
                    <p>CryptoNovice is a crypto information website that specializes in crypto‑based information. We exist to <strong>educate, inform, and equip</strong> users – from complete beginners to crypto enthusiasts – with the best tools and platforms to ensure they make informed decisions in the crypto space.</p>
                    <p>Our aim is to <strong>simplify information</strong> about crypto by leading users to the best podcasts, articles, and other alternative sources of information, so you can understand and learn at your own pace.</p>
                    <div class="disclaimer-badge">
                        <i class="fas fa-exclamation-triangle"></i> <strong>Disclaimer:</strong> We are not financial advisors. This website exists solely to equip crypto novices and enthusiasts with the best tools and platforms in order to make an informed decision. Always do your own research.
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="stats">
                    <div class="stat-item">
                        <div class="stat-number">240</div>
                        <div class="stat-label">Students</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="stat-item">
                        <div class="stat-number">150</div>
                        <div class="stat-label">Subscribers</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="stat-item">
                        <div class="stat-number">5</div>
                        <div class="stat-label">Articles</div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <h2 class="section-title">What You'll Gain</h2>
                <p class="section-subtitle">Start your crypto journey with confidence</p>
                <div class="grid-3">
                    <div class="card" onclick="switchPage('articles')">
                        <div class="card-icon">🎓</div>
                        <h3>Understand the Lingo</h3>
                        <p>Bitcoin, Ethereum, blockchain – made simple. Our articles break down complex terms into plain English.</p>
